	(text "REGOUT0. UICR.REGOUT0.VOUT must be written to 3.3 V, field value 5 at offset 0x304."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 266.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "54c475d2-df74-58cf-b672-baa3381d7c50")
	)
	(text "The factory default is 1.8 V, so a board that skips the write brings every GPIO and"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 271.145 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "4a7c06f1-e65c-527d-831c-799f2d432b81")
	)
	(text "the 3V3 pad up at 1.8 V and browns out under load. ERASEALL and --recover both wipe"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 275.59 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "2b9537da-f986-57ab-a15f-a03cb865aab3")
	)
	(text "UICR, so the write has to be repeated after any debug recovery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 280.035 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "34478e9e-6a31-55be-9eb7-a9336900e0dc")
	)
	(text "High voltage mode is a wiring decision and not a register write. VBUS reaches VDDH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 288.925 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "99fe1218-5f16-595e-a230-bf5917b32a36")
	)
	(text "through R1 and nothing drives VDD, so REG0 regulates VDDH down and VDD becomes the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 293.37 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "bcecbcee-68fd-5dbe-abb6-1b35e6823e90")
	)
	(text "3.3 V output. Never drive the 3V3 pad from outside."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 297.815 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "a2755ae8-62c3-54d1-8e31-da8dd75623f8")
	)
	(text "Never enable the DC/DC regulator. There is no external LC filter on this board and"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 306.705 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "20700834-dcad-5fe0-a556-92fc30c633d1")
	)
	(text "there is not going to be one; enabling it inhibits device operation including debug"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 311.15 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "471a5901-c9b1-5377-972f-bc16bb7182fe")
	)
	(text "access until a filter is fitted. DCC and DCCH stay open and no inductor is fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 315.595 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "058fffec-1ba8-5c68-b00a-6b6f7ac399a6")
	)
	(text "The match is Nordic configuration 1 for the aQFN73, three components: C14 0.8 pF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 324.485 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "caf506c6-e68a-5385-994b-fd9155ee30c1")
	)
	(text "shunt, L1 4.7 nH series, C15 0.5 pF shunt, NP0 at plus or minus 10 percent. That is"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 328.93 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "31d310d7-dba8-515c-9539-73f61916f0d5")
	)
	(text "the configuration whose supply topology this board has, VDDH from VBUS on the LDO"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 333.375 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "35460de8-87a6-5200-8001-3b763e777dc7")
	)
	(text "with no DC/DC and no NFC. The four component values that stood here are Nordic"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 337.82 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "f3b491b1-ba1a-525a-bacb-54baf469e090")
	)
	(text "configuration 7, the battery DC/DC arrangement, and they are struck. Nordic draws a"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 342.265 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "4bf07414-5093-59eb-b29a-962f660511de")
	)
	(text "third shunt C22 on the same node and leaves it unmounted; C16 already sits there."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 346.71 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "642eef5a-b585-5e18-bceb-04c54311ca12")
	)
	(text "C14 returns to U1 pin F23 VSS_PA and not to the plane. F23 is a ground pin and sits"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 355.6 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "45167322-264d-5f30-89b8-8800ebd1af4e")
	)
	(text "on GND, as Nordic draws it. The routing is what filters harmonics, not a split net."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 360.045 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "463a89b7-2ec9-58dd-b01d-b51e55cbb555")
	)
	(text "ANT_FEED ends at AE1, a custom 0.850 x 7.435 mm F.Cu radiator requiring EM and VNA validation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 368.935 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "c76e3895-4072-5fec-b2d0-4245b342462a")
	)
	(text "APPROTECT follows the build code shipped under the -R order code. Dxx and earlier"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 377.825 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "08967560-c75f-5154-87a5-475633549551")
	)
	(text "attach over SWD with no ERASEALL; Fxx and later need an ERASEALL through CTRL-AP"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 382.27 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "dae638e3-648d-5fa6-aba1-b2faacf2fed2")
	)
	(text "first, then UICR.APPROTECT plus the APPROTECT.DISABLE register on every boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 386.715 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "d730a9f7-3a12-51d9-8c40-cc601b73a9d2")
	)
	(text "PSELRESET. The E7 pad is P0.18 and is a plain GPIO until UICR.PSELRESET[0] at 0x200"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 395.605 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "ed621b8c-10d7-57d8-aa43-2e0ed4ef8b11")
	)
	(text "and PSELRESET[1] at 0x204 both read 18. Until then the pad does nothing and the only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 400.05 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "9ad95c73-ac0a-5d02-924a-ba1078b4a0df")
	)
	(text "way in is SWD. ERASEALL wipes it alongside REGOUT0, so both get rewritten together."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 404.495 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "8ffa6231-aba0-59da-aa8e-0101226b7614")
	)
